# @hub-lanes
# PR-url reconciler (#848): a build whose `gh pr create` died on the App GraphQL
# cap writes PR_CREATE_FAILED, and the sweep below only walks records whose line 1
# says PR_CREATED — so the PR that WAS opened is invisible. This runs three
# minutes ahead of each sweep tick, so a relinked record is swept on the next one.
3,13,23,33,43,53 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/pr-url-reconcile.sh >> /root/harness/logs/pr-url-reconcile.log 2>&1
